window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A vacation at a luxurious Alien Resort sounds wonderful...until Kara is kidnapped and sold to a brothel. Will her Kindred coworker, J'orn, reach her in time?<br> <br> What do you do when you meet your soul mate…and she refuses to believe you belong together? J’orn is a seven-foot-tall Kindred warrior and that’s his dilemma. He’s been in love with Kara from the start, but because she’s older than him, she won’t even consider him as a romantic interest. But then she buys an economy ticket to Paradise Prime and ends up sitting in his lap during the journey. J’orn tries to warn her of the Kidnapping ring operating there, but she refuses to listen.<br> <br> Kara can’t believe she has to sit on J’orn’s lap all the way to Paradise Prime! She’s not worried when he warns her of the Kidnapping ring he’s going to investigate because she’s booked at a women-only resort. But what happens when he has to pose as her massage therapist in order to catch the kidnappers and the massage has a *very* happy ending?<br> You’ll have to listen to this older woman/younger man, coworkers-to-lovers, spicy age gap romance to find out!<br> <br> *Author's Note: this is book 2 in my Kindred Spicy Shorts series. These books are all stand alone novellas set in my Kindred Tales universe and can be listened to in any order.</p>"; 
